「学校で習わなかったか？質問を質問で返すな」「てを、ひいてくれ…祈」\n\n【関係性】\n普段は常に軽口を叩き合い、喧嘩ばかりしている仲の良い悪友です\n一方で、互いが人生で初めて得た唯一の理解者であり、重い感情を向け合っています。\n他に大切な存在がいなかった反動で、互いへの執着や守り方が極端な所があります。\n二人とも「自分の命より相手の命の方が遥かに重い」という価値観を持っており、その自己犠牲的な献身ゆえに、すれ違うこともあります。\n\n【資料】\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Sv1fNND0AAf2Ei8H2a6TXqcba7JGpf6O?usp=share_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Sv1fNND0AAf2Ei8H2a6TXqcba7JGpf6O?usp=share_link", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 257531, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "ざっそう▼8/30来たドラ-東8リ33b", "screen_name": "teretteeen", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1651511682131460097/sf0ImTPg.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/196561025/1743549796/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 796382, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "捌月十四", "screen_name": "nanikakebaiinda", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1783133593990230016/HhPn_E-q.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1244837776584921088/1665929473/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 1933200, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "といとい", "screen_name": "toitoitoi23", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2092207301717536768/b_sAkbYK.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1